OL,3,ATrump $1 coin makes him first living
OL,4,Apresident on US currency in a century
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe coins - priced at $61 (#45) for a
OL,7,Froll of 25 and $154.50 for a bag of 100
OL,8,F- were "not currently in stock" on the
OL,9,Fmint's website within hours of going on
OL,10,Fsale. The BBC has contacted the US
OL,11,FMint, the Treasury and the White House
OL,12,Ffor further details.
